 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【足球战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-07/match2133877date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进军决赛！U17国足点球3-1河床U17将战阿森纳 江宇涵替补两扑点</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.57" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260807/zhanbao_image_2133877_1786112035_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.57" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.57" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260807/zhanbao_image_2133877_1786112035_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260807/zhanbao_image_2133877_1786112035_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">U17国足总比分3-1击败河床U17，进军上海明日之星冠军杯决赛，决赛将再度迎战阿森纳U17，决赛将于8月9日14:30开赛。</span></p><p>【转会及其他足球动态】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a764d64500e8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">突发HWG！罗马诺：利物浦租借巴萨中卫阿劳霍达口头协议</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a764f2a3a08dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG确认！罗马诺：利物浦需要补充中卫深度，如今出手签下阿劳霍</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080527202346_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080527202346_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080527202346_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">罗马诺独家消息，利物浦租借签下巴萨中卫阿劳霍达协议，HWG！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a760f9970e53native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：曼城签34岁阿根廷门将鲁利达协议，合同2+1</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080102545380_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080102545380_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080102545380_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">罗马诺消息，曼城签下阿根廷门将鲁利，Here we go!</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a76486e65d7anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：因凡蒂诺任职欧足联时与一女子有染，欧足联付6位数封口费</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080517146907.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080517146907_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080517146907_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">《电讯报》爆料，因凡蒂诺担任欧足联秘书长期间与一女子有染，欧足联曾向他的所谓情妇支付了一笔赔偿金。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a76017094366native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">有情况？葡媒：菲利克斯与前女友夜店相遇，交谈后社媒再次互关</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.67" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080002259841.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080002259841.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608080002259841.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据葡媒《晨邮报》报道，菲利克斯与前女友科塞罗现身同一家夜店，两人社媒也再次互相关注。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-07/6a75fc0dd4929native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">科贝电台：皇马今夏不会再签中场，穆帅计划让B席踢主力</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260804/202608040459256645.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260804/202608040459256645.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260804/202608040459256645.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">根据科贝电台消息，皇马今夏不会再签中场球员，穆里尼奥计划让B席扮演中场核心角色。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-07/6a75fea725b33native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">1.5亿欧！记者：利物浦表示无力支付巴黎对巴尔科拉的要价</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a75ff269ff96_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a75ff269ff96_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a75ff269ff96_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者Sacha Tavolieri消息，利物浦谈判中表示无法满足巴黎对巴尔科拉的要价。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a7602699719fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：马斯坦托诺是免费纯租借加盟佛罗伦萨，后者承担全额薪水</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250924/68d3d46f84b4e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250924/68d3d46f84b4e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250924/68d3d46f84b4e.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">皇马将小将马斯坦托诺外租至佛罗伦萨进行锻炼，阿根廷人预计会获得更多的一线队出场时间。对于这笔交易，记者Orazio Accomando透露了一些条款的细节。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a76058847955native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">纽卡总监：我们不想出售吉马良斯但不得不权衡，他明确说出了意愿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260808/202608080026141740.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_androi