0%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ee374225ea.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ee374225ea.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据西班牙《阿斯报》报道，巴西中场吉马良斯已经加盟阿森纳，但官方公告被推迟公布。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a762c3871320native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">科贝：罗德里本赛季与瓜帅进行过交流，被建议选择巴萨，而非皇马</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.32" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241029/6720bb3b0a7d8.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.32" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.32" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241029/6720bb3b0a7d8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241029/6720bb3b0a7d8.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据西班牙科贝电台的报道，罗德里在本赛季曾与俱乐部主帅瓜迪奥拉进行过交流，被瓜帅建议在皇马或巴萨之间选择巴萨。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a763f1705b95native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨说服罗德里内幕：德科秘密会谈数小时 弗里克多次致电</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: 